# Awesome DESIGN.md

When building or restyling UI, use the curated DESIGN.md library:

- Global clone: `~/.cursor/awesome-design-md/design-md/<brand>/DESIGN.md`
- Skill: `awesome-design-md`
- Upstream: https://github.com/VoltAgent/awesome-design-md

Pick a brand, read its DESIGN.md, optionally install it as project `DESIGN.md`, then match tokens/layout — don’t invent a conflicting visual system.
